ht" source="#source-7250-7262"><rb>出</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7262-7298">で、ポケツトヘ手を入れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7298-7313"><rb>空</rb><rt>から</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7313-7361">ツポウではありますけれども、紙を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7361-7376"><rb>畳</rb><rt>たゝ</rt></ruby>んで、小「これはお<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7403-7430"><rb>使賃</rb><rt>つかひちん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7430-7439">だよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7439-7454"><rb>是</rb><rt>これ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7454-7502">からお忘れでないよ。これで先生も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7502-7529"><rb>使賃</rb><rt>つかひちん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7529-7544">をやる事を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7544-7559"><rb>覚</rb><rt>おぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7559-7565">え、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7565-7580"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7580-7601"><rb>小僧</rb><rt>こぞう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7601-7610">さんも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7610-7634"><rb>行儀</rb><rt>ぎやうぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7634-7637">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7637-7652"><rb>直</rb><rt>なほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7652-7685">つたといふお話で、誠に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7685-7706"><rb>西洋</rb><rt>あちら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7706-7709">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7709-7730"><rb>小僧</rb><rt>こぞう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7730-7739">さんは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7739-7766"><rb>狡猾</rb><rt>かうくわつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7766-7769">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7769-7790"><rb>怜悧</rb><rt>りこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7790-7793">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7793-7811"><rb>処</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7811-7832">がありますが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7832-7853"><rb>日本</rb><rt>こちら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7853-7856">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7856-7877"><rb>小僧</rb><rt>こぞう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7877-7886">さんは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7886-7901"><rb>極</rb><rt>ごく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7901-7925"><rb>穏当</rb><rt>をんたう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7925-7940">なもので。</seg></p>
